# GitHub personal access token read at request time by the Vercel function
# api/github-contributions.js. Requires the read:user scope (classic token),
# nothing more. Set it in the Vercel project's environment variables.
# Deliberately has no VITE_ prefix: a VITE_-prefixed value is inlined into the
# client bundle by Vite and would be readable by every visitor.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
